 here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025 the middle ran 53% of normal for August to September and 36% for January to February. So far in 2026 it ran 185% for March to April. Grid 23571 shows a preliminary estimate of 142.3 for August to September 2026, and its driest year was 1976 at 70%.</p>"}
